<section class="px-5 md:px-30 py-8 md:py-14 bg-subtle text-ink"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:gap-11"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:gap-3.5"><p class="font-medium text-[10px] md:text-[11.5px] tracking-[0.15em] md:tracking-[0.16em] text-accent">WHAT WE DO</p><h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[25px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.16] md:leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.005em] max-w-[54rem]">Eight jobs. We do them properly and we say no to the rest.</h2><p class="max-w-[52rem] text-[15px] md:text-[17px] leading-[1.58] text-ink-soft">Every price below is the real starting flat rate, confirmed on site before we begin.</p></div><div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[12px] border border-rule bg-surface px-6 pb-[26px] pt-6"><p class="font-display text-[19px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-ink">Blocked drains</p><p class="font-display font-num text-[17px] font-bold text-accent">from $149</p><p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-soft">Machine cleared, camera checked, and we tell you what caused it so it does not happen again in six weeks.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[12px] border border-rule bg-surface px-6 pb-[26px] pt-6"><p class="font-display text-[19px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-ink">Burst &#38; leaking pipes</p><p class="font-display font-num text-[17px] font-bold text-accent">from $265</p><p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-soft">Located acoustically before anything is opened up. No exploratory holes in your walls or driveway.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[12px] border border-rule bg-surface px-6 pb-[26px] pt-6"><p class="font-display text-[19px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-ink">Hot water systems</p><p class="font-display font-num text-[17px] font-bold text-accent">from $215</p><p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-soft">We try to repair first. We only recommend replacement when repair is throwing good money after bad.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[12px] border border-rule bg-surface px-6 pb-[26px] pt-6"><p class="font-display text-[19px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-ink">Taps, toilets &#38; cisterns</p><p class="font-display font-num text-[17px] font-bold text-accent">from $129</p><p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-soft">The small jobs most plumbers will not drive out for. Same flat-rate promise applies.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[12px] border border-rule bg-surface px-6 pb-[26px] pt-6"><p class="font-display text-[19px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-ink">Sewer lines</p><p class="font-display font-num text-[17px] font-bold text-accent">from $390</p><p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-soft">CCTV inspection, clear, and a written report in a format your insurer will accept.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[12px] border border-rule bg-surface px-6 pb-[26px] pt-6"><p class="font-display text-[19px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-ink">Leak detection</p><p class="font-display font-num text-[17px] font-bold text-accent">from $199</p><p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-soft">Acoustic and thermal imaging. We find it before we open a wall, not after.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[12px] border border-rule bg-surface px-6 pb-[26px] pt-6"><p class="font-display text-[19px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-ink">Whole-house repipes</p><p class="font-display font-num text-[17px] font-bold text-accent">from $4,800</p><p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-soft">Staged so you never lose water overnight. Fixed price for the whole job, not per fitting.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[12px] border border-rule bg-surface px-6 pb-[26px] pt-6"><p class="font-display text-[19px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-ink">Bathroom &#38; kitchen fit-out</p><p class="font-display font-num text-[17px] font-bold text-accent">quoted</p><p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-soft">Rough-in through to final fix, sequenced around your tiler and cabinetmaker.</p></div></div></div></section>
